    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atiŋo waŋa malo ci aneno dano mo ma tye ki tol lapim piny i ci;ŋe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok apenye ni, “In mono ibicito wa kwene kaa?” En owacca ni, “Acito ka pimo Jerucalem, wek anen kit ma lacce tye kwede ki kit ma borre tye kwede.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lamalaika ma obedo ka lok kweda-ni ocako bino, ki lamalaika mukene bene obino ka rwatte kwede. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci owaco bot lawote ni, “Rin icit wa bot awobi ca iciwacce ni, ‘Jerucalem bibedo apero laboŋo cel murume, pi lwak dano ki lim makwo madwoŋ ma bibedo iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien an kikoma aye abibedo macalo cel gogo me mac ma orumogi, an aye abibedo deyone ma nen ki i iye kunnu, man lok pa Rwot kikome.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wun jo-ni! Wun jo-ni! Wuriŋ, wua woko ki i lobo ma yo tuŋ acam, man lok pa Rwot kikome, pien con aketo iwu woko atata macalo yamo aŋwen me polo, man lok pa Rwot kikome. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wun jo-ni, wulwi, wuriŋ woko wa i Cion, wun jo ma wubedo i Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien ŋat ma ogudo komwu noŋo ogudo pal cwiny Rwot me mony, I kare ma en Won Deyo oora bot lurok mapatpat ma yam guyakowu, en Rwot me mony owaco kuman ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Koŋ wunen ba, abiyeŋo ciŋa i wigi ci gin lurok gibidoko ginayaka pa jo ma yam koŋ gubedo opii-gi. Tim macalo meno bimiyo wuŋeyo ni, Rwot me mony aye muora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doŋ wuwer ki yomcwiny, wun jo Cion; pien nen an doŋ abino ka bedo i dyewu, man lok pa Rwot kikome. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rok mapol gibiribbe i kom Rwot i nino meno, ci doŋ gibidoko jona. An bene abibedo i dyewu, dok wubineyo ni, Rwot me mony aye muora botwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot bigamo Juda macalo dul ma gipokke ki i lobo maleŋ; en dok biyero Jerucalem aye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuliŋ mot i nyim Rwot wun jo ducu, pien en doŋ oco woko ki i kabedone maleŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
